  <jpcrp030000-asr_E02388-000:NoteToLiquidationLossOnSubcontractingTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※３　解約清算費用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:31pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;当事業年度において、外注委託撤退に伴い発生した清算費用を計上しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E02388-000:NoteToLiquidationLossOnSubcontractingTextBlock>
